## WHATWG Encoding Standard（CC BY 4.0）

`engine/plugins/learning/gbk-table.mjs` 是 GBK 双字节编码到 Unicode 的对照表，取自 WHATWG Encoding Standard 的 gb18030 索引（由带完整 ICU 的 Node 解码生成，见文件开头的说明）。深度研究用它读取 GBK / GB2312 编码的中文网页，因为 App 里的 Node 不带这个解码器。

`engine/plugins/learning/gbk-table.mjs` is a table of GBK two-byte codes and the Unicode characters they decode to, taken from the gb18030 index of the WHATWG Encoding Standard (generated by decoding with a full-ICU Node; see the file's header). Deep research uses it to read Chinese pages in GBK / GB2312, which the app's Node cannot decode.

